        <div class="eyebrow light">About Roy</div>
        <h1>Tech entrepreneur. Builder. A practical voice for Vancouver-Langara.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Roy Li is a technology entrepreneur seeking the BC Conservative nomination in Vancouver-Langara, with a deep interest in responsible government and the future of British Columbia.</p>
      </div>
